    "Trending top 10 and Token Info percentages were taken from a signed-in GMGN Solana 1h Trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol (Trending tab, 1h, confirmed selected in trending.png) at ~8:20 AM ET and checked against trending.png and token-info-crop.png / token-info-crop-2.png. price was not shown on the table (stored null). Token Info icons: green-person % = insiderPct, stacked-layers % = top10Pct, diamond/crosshair % = sniperPct (the crosshair figure on the second line, after the hook icon). Hook-like and clipboard/document chips, plus Tax / DS / Unpaid / $299 / CTO, were not mapped into those three fields. ALLOC and kol showed a small % chip in place of DS; layers were still taken as the 4th chip on line 1.",
