    "Addresses for all 10 trending rows came from GMGN token-link hrefs in the same session, in screenshot order.",
    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy/Buy More rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill. The stored tape is a DOM-text union over 13 scroll steps after the initial view (100 token cards seen; each card showed only 3-4 wallet rows even when its header count was larger). 17 truncated wallet rows that showed only a wallet label and no amount, age, or action were skipped. Inflow screenshots cover the top screens of a retake after a fresh load and do not exactly match the parsed pass; lower cards were read from the board DOM and are not all in a screenshot. The board is live and virtualized, so later rows are a DOM-text union; ages are first-seen. No subscript inflow figures were seen in this capture.",
