    "Daily top-15 smart-degen wallet recapture was done in this 8 AM ET first run of the day (asOfET 8:34 AM ET, Nov 25, 2026) from https://gmgn.ai/rank?chain=sol&tab=smart_degen (Smart Money filter, 7D, sorted by 7D PnL descending). 15 full addresses were taken from /sol/address/ hrefs. Labels were not shown (abbreviated addresses only). Tags appeared only as icons, not readable text, so tags are empty arrays. 30D PnL was not shown on the 7D view (null). lastActive was taken from the same-session rank-page capture.",
